<span class="printed" data-width="80.08" style="left:596.16px;top:40.806px;font-size:10.72px;font-weight:400;color:#000000">(35쪽 중 제2쪽)</span>
<span class="printed" data-width="14.72" style="left:307.84px;top:70.246px;font-size:14.72px;font-weight:400;color:#000000">❶</span>
<span class="printed" data-width="14.72" style="left:322.56px;top:70.246px;font-size:14.72px;font-weight:400;color:#000000">∼</span>
<span class="printed" data-width="19.622" style="left:337.12px;top:70.246px;font-size:14.72px;font-weight:400;color:#000000">❹ </span>
<span class="printed" data-width="48.648" style="left:359.2px;top:71.795px;font-size:12.96px;font-weight:400;color:#000000">작성방법</span>
<span class="printed" data-width="309.36" style="left:39.68px;top:101.286px;font-size:10.72px;font-weight:400;color:#000000">  1. 신고하는 귀속연도와 거주구분 등에 관한 표를 적습니다.</span>
<span class="printed" data-width="21.36" style="left:39.68px;top:120.486px;font-size:10.72px;font-weight:400;color:#000000">  2.</span>
<span class="printed" data-width="506.8" style="left:66.24px;top:120.486px;font-size:10.72px;font-weight:400;color:#000000">② 주민등록번호란: 외국인은 외국인등록번호(외국인등록번호가 없는 경우에는 여권번호)를 적습니다.</span>
<span class="printed" data-width="205.679" style="left:39.68px;top:139.686px;font-size:10.72px;font-weight:400;color:#000000">  3. ⑨ 신고유형란: 해당되는 신고유형에 </span>
